WEBVTT

00:05.430 --> 00:07.959
Is this for me?

00:07.960 --> 00:11.320
Yeah. Atla and I made it this morning.

00:18.060 --> 00:20.330
I hope it suits your taste.

00:25.880 --> 00:27.090
This is...

00:28.070 --> 00:30.800
They call it "a mother's home cooking."

00:33.880 --> 00:35.640
Is it too salty?

00:36.030 --> 00:38.270
Huh? Ah, no...

00:39.830 --> 00:42.790
It's good. Really good.

00:44.270 --> 00:45.880
It's really delicious.

00:46.750 --> 00:49.279
So, Fohl and Atla really are...

00:49.280 --> 00:52.280
...the children of Lucia, Trash's sister.

00:52.950 --> 00:55.580
Should we tell Fohl and Atla as well?

00:57.230 --> 01:01.440
He says just being able to form a connection
with them is enough for him.

01:01.910 --> 01:03.949
How was Siltvelt?

01:03.950 --> 01:06.510
I hear you had quite
a few troubles there.

01:07.180 --> 01:10.509
I've come to understand the precognition
you told me about firsthand.

01:10.510 --> 01:12.720
Thanks to you, Master Iwatani,

01:13.060 --> 01:17.890
the Siltvelt army has now agreed
to help in dealing with the Phoenix.

01:18.310 --> 01:20.609
Always quick to make arrangements, I see.

01:20.610 --> 01:24.480
Right now, preparations for the Phoenix
battle take priority above all else.

01:24.990 --> 01:27.190
So, Master Iwatani...

01:27.760 --> 01:29.939
Of course I'll deal with the Phoenix,

01:29.940 --> 01:32.760
but I'll also settle the issue with Q'ten Lo.

01:33.210 --> 01:35.079
If we leave problems festering in the rear,

01:35.080 --> 01:37.290
we can't concentrate our
forces on the front lines.

01:37.930 --> 01:39.500
Understood.

01:39.900 --> 01:40.870
Raphtalia.

01:41.190 --> 01:42.059
Yes.

01:42.060 --> 01:47.760
The next time we meet,
I might be welcoming you as a state guest.

01:49.390 --> 01:51.880
I'm sorry, even though
we're in such a crisis...

01:52.210 --> 01:54.470
It's nothing for you
to worry about, Raphtalia.

01:54.740 --> 01:57.540
I'm just doing what I should as a lord.

01:58.390 --> 01:59.850
Master Naofumi!

02:00.560 --> 02:02.689
How did he react
to your home-cooked meal?

02:02.690 --> 02:04.479
As you can see.

02:04.480 --> 02:06.290
He ate it so deliciously.

02:07.200 --> 02:09.759
If you're done with your business here,
let's get back.

02:09.760 --> 02:11.860
We leave as soon as preparations are ready.

02:12.260 --> 02:13.170
Yes!

02:22.370 --> 02:26.080
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

03:45.750 --> 03:48.459
EPISODE 6: SETTING SAIL

03:48.460 --> 03:50.039
EPISODE 6: SETTING SAIL
Count, you've come back!

03:50.040 --> 03:50.800
Count, you've come back!

03:52.130 --> 03:53.259
What's going on?

03:53.260 --> 03:56.119
I'm back to choose the members
that'll go to Q'ten Lo.

03:56.120 --> 03:57.130
How about them?

03:57.410 --> 04:00.700
Thanks to everyone in the village,
they've gotten really strong.

04:01.620 --> 04:04.159
It's always better to have more people,

04:04.160 --> 04:07.179
but we also need to keep
the village protected.

04:07.180 --> 04:10.890
If big sister Sadeena comes with us,
that would be reassuring.

04:11.660 --> 04:14.440
She's well familiar with the area.
Next would be...

04:14.930 --> 04:17.240
Atla and Fohl, I suppose.

04:17.710 --> 04:20.530
They did great in Siltvelt after all.

04:21.000 --> 04:22.779
By the way,
where are Itsuki and Ren?

04:22.780 --> 04:25.749
They're training right now.
They said they'd be back by night.

04:25.750 --> 04:30.379
Even though the curse still affects them,
they are the Four Cardinal Heroes.

04:30.380 --> 04:33.589
- I'd like at least one of them to join...
- If you're going to Q'ten Lo,

04:33.590 --> 04:35.300
you should take him along.

04:35.630 --> 04:36.710
Gaelion?

04:37.010 --> 04:40.509
Q'ten Lo is a country protected
by the Water Dragon.

04:40.510 --> 04:45.270
Since Gaelion's also a dragon, he should be
able to sense the Water Dragon's presence.

04:46.640 --> 04:48.469
Alright, let's bring him along then.

04:48.470 --> 04:51.149
That's not fair! I want to go too!

04:51.150 --> 04:53.170
I can fight, you know!

04:54.230 --> 04:57.129
Do you remember
when the village was attacked?

04:57.130 --> 04:57.779
Yeah.

04:57.780 --> 05:00.219
We don't know when they might come again.

05:00.220 --> 05:03.260
Protecting everyone's lives
is an important job too.

05:03.820 --> 05:04.730
Can I trust you?

05:05.250 --> 05:05.870
Yes!

05:06.430 --> 05:07.909
Alright, then...

05:07.910 --> 05:10.140
Young boy, are you there?

05:11.960 --> 05:12.919
Hey.

05:12.920 --> 05:14.479
What is it, old man?

05:14.480 --> 05:16.920
Could you also take me along to Q'ten Lo?

05:18.040 --> 05:21.410
I checked out the weapons of the guys
who attacked us the other day.

05:21.980 --> 05:25.389
I'm pretty sure the one
who made them was my master.

05:25.390 --> 05:26.510
Are you sure?

05:26.780 --> 05:28.350
I can tell it from its looks.

05:28.920 --> 05:32.980
My master's been missing for a long time,
so I might finally be able to find him.

05:33.450 --> 05:34.250
Please!

05:35.750 --> 05:38.779
It's going to be a dangerous journey.
Are you alright with that?

05:38.780 --> 05:40.989
BLUE EGGU SHIELD (APPRAISAL 1) ACTIVATED
I used to be an adventurer, you know.

05:40.990 --> 05:43.359
BLUE EGGU SHIELD (APPRAISAL 1) ACTIVATED
My level's about 87.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.620
BLUE EGGU SHIELD (APPRAISAL 1) ACTIVATED
That's quite high!

05:44.900 --> 05:47.929
I'll handle weapon maintenance
along the way, too.

05:47.930 --> 05:49.649
Alright. I'll be counting on you.

05:49.650 --> 05:51.240
Thank you so much!

05:52.600 --> 05:55.750
So that explains
where he got those sword skills.

05:56.120 --> 05:58.919
He was your very first master, after all.

05:58.920 --> 06:01.960
Now, we just have to wait for Itsuki
and the others to get back.

06:02.360 --> 06:04.119
I'd like to depart tomorrow morning...

06:04.120 --> 06:05.469
Mister!

06:05.470 --> 06:07.600
Please help me!

06:08.860 --> 06:10.789
What's with that outfit?

06:10.790 --> 06:13.639
Imiya and S'yne made me wear it!

06:13.640 --> 06:15.350
Crossdressing, huh?

06:15.890 --> 06:17.819
No, he's not a boy.

06:17.820 --> 06:20.189
Actually, she's a girl.

06:20.190 --> 06:21.649
What?!

06:21.650 --> 06:25.109
We found out when we took her
measurements for a seller's outfit.

06:25.110 --> 06:28.139
I always thought I am a boy!

06:28.140 --> 06:29.200
Me too...

06:29.560 --> 06:31.599
But still, what's with that outfit?

06:31.600 --> 06:34.170
Apparently, it inspired
people's creative urges.

06:34.480 --> 06:36.599
And she became a big attraction.

06:36.600 --> 06:38.210
I'm not happy about it!

06:38.500 --> 06:39.019
No...

06:39.020 --> 06:40.349
Master Naofumi?

06:40.350 --> 06:43.759
Keel, whenever you go peddling,
you have to wear that outfit.

06:43.760 --> 06:44.779
What?!

06:44.780 --> 06:47.489
In business, it's all about
catching people's attention.

06:47.490 --> 06:48.849
We can make use...

06:48.850 --> 06:49.879
...of your talent!

06:49.880 --> 06:52.599
But I want to become a strong man!

06:52.600 --> 06:55.240
Whether you're a man or a woman,
you have to be worthy.

06:55.670 --> 06:56.690
Got it?

06:57.390 --> 06:59.400
If you say so...

06:59.970 --> 07:03.109
Master Naofumi, your eyes
look like money right now.

07:03.110 --> 07:05.920
You haven't changed a bit, young boy.

07:08.740 --> 07:10.280
Naofumi!

07:10.930 --> 07:12.379
So you've come back.

07:12.380 --> 07:15.379
I hear you had a rough time in Siltvelt.

07:15.380 --> 07:16.580
Yeah, a lot happened.

07:16.990 --> 07:19.710
Was there anything unusual
in the village while I was gone?

07:20.040 --> 07:22.379
There was no assassin attack,

07:22.380 --> 07:25.080
but there were traces of explosions
around the village.

07:25.630 --> 07:28.449
Maybe someone was trying to set traps.

07:28.450 --> 07:31.600
Or maybe they engaged with someone.

07:32.260 --> 07:34.280
But who?

07:43.690 --> 07:45.879
Suspicious people spotted!

07:45.880 --> 07:46.740
Who's there?!

07:48.570 --> 07:50.490
It's me!

07:56.950 --> 07:59.479
My spear's not having much effect, huh?

07:59.480 --> 08:00.330
Then...!

08:01.340 --> 08:03.670
As the source of thy power,
I command thee...

08:04.040 --> 08:08.340
Decipher the laws of nature and burn
to ash all who stand before me!

08:09.430 --> 08:13.470
Drifa Fire Storm!

08:16.710 --> 08:19.250
Filth must be purged!

08:20.400 --> 08:22.440
On to the next location!

08:24.710 --> 08:26.769
Good thing nothing happened.

08:26.770 --> 08:29.110
Let's go check it out next time.

08:29.640 --> 08:30.950
Hey, Naofumi.

08:31.230 --> 08:32.039
What is it?

08:32.040 --> 08:36.610
I know you're busy, but don't forget
about Fitoria's request.

08:37.160 --> 08:39.369
Once the issue with Q'ten Lo
is settled, that's it.

08:39.370 --> 08:42.749
But we already took the payment
in advance, you know.

08:42.750 --> 08:43.779
Yeah.

08:43.780 --> 08:45.059
Mel!

08:45.060 --> 08:46.639
I'll be right there, so wait for me!

08:46.640 --> 08:48.319
Let's play!

08:48.320 --> 08:50.429
I'm still talking here!

08:50.430 --> 08:52.329
A request, huh...

08:52.330 --> 08:55.699
She said it was to help
the Four Cardinal Heroes get along better...

08:55.700 --> 08:59.220
Ren, can you please take a look
at the shopping list?

09:00.240 --> 09:03.689
Let's add dried meat.
We were running low on stock.

09:03.690 --> 09:05.690
Thank you as always.

09:06.290 --> 09:08.149
Looks like people rely on you.

09:08.150 --> 09:10.630
I just want to do whatever I can.

09:11.320 --> 09:13.240
I'm part of the village too, after all.

09:13.680 --> 09:17.579
Naofumi, should we come along
to Q'ten Lo as well?

09:17.580 --> 09:18.910
Yeah.

09:19.660 --> 09:22.780
Our Holy Weapons might not
be effective against them,

09:23.710 --> 09:25.819
but the trip to Q'ten Lo will be by ship.

09:25.820 --> 09:30.289
If we get into a fight at sea,
ranged attacks will be useful.

09:30.290 --> 09:33.289
Itsuki, Rishia, will you come?

09:33.290 --> 09:34.259
Understood.

09:34.260 --> 09:37.009
Eh? I-I'll do my best...

09:37.010 --> 09:40.809
Ren, I'd like you to take command
if the village is attacked.

09:40.810 --> 09:43.649
Can you protect it together with Eclair?

09:43.650 --> 09:44.619
Alright.

09:44.620 --> 09:48.110
The villagers seem to rely on you too.

09:48.610 --> 09:51.049
For now, focus on lifting your curse.

09:51.050 --> 09:53.199
If we need you,
I'll call you through the portal.

09:53.200 --> 09:54.620
Got it.

09:58.850 --> 10:00.769
Um, Master Naofumi.

10:00.770 --> 10:01.500
Hmm?

10:02.440 --> 10:05.330
What exactly is "Heavenly Emperor"?

10:06.200 --> 10:10.050
They even sent their assassins
just to protect one's position...

10:10.500 --> 10:15.509
Clinging to status and power
is just human nature.

10:15.510 --> 10:18.100
But I have no interest in such things.

10:18.930 --> 10:22.400
Then make sure to tell that
to the people of Q'ten Lo.

10:23.100 --> 10:23.810
Yes.

10:24.650 --> 10:28.520
Whether they'll understand or not
is another matter, though.

10:41.350 --> 10:44.029
Have the supplies I requested been prepared?

10:44.030 --> 10:44.750
Yes!

10:45.830 --> 10:50.000
Almost all of the supplies have been loaded,
and there is about 10% remaining.

10:51.820 --> 10:54.040
This much is just 10%?!

10:54.520 --> 10:57.889
We couldn't risk anything
happening to the Hero,

10:57.890 --> 11:00.990
so we prepared a little extra.

11:01.780 --> 11:05.070
Just as the rumors say,
they're very generous!

11:06.150 --> 11:09.860
Though it seems I'm not
exactly welcome here.

11:10.890 --> 11:12.990
It seems so.

11:17.110 --> 11:18.870
Alright, let's board.

11:19.700 --> 11:21.570
We sail as soon as the loading's finished.

11:22.980 --> 11:25.580
I humbly report to you, Heavenly Emperor.

11:25.880 --> 11:31.499
The false Heavenly Emperor's party
has set sail toward our country.

11:31.500 --> 11:33.340
But please rest assured.

11:33.890 --> 11:38.840
Those insolent ones who defy the heavens
will not even be allowed to set foot here.

11:39.140 --> 11:42.309
Leave everything to me.

11:42.310 --> 11:48.009
I shall make your gentle heart known
to all the people, Heavenly Emperor.

11:48.010 --> 11:52.940
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

11:58.600 --> 12:00.569
It's like flying!

12:00.570 --> 12:03.160
Stop posing like that on the ship!
It's bad luck!

12:09.750 --> 12:11.669
That's a mysterious light.

12:11.670 --> 12:14.869
We can't reach Q'ten Lo without it.

12:14.870 --> 12:15.710
Look.

12:18.680 --> 12:20.439
Whirlpools?

12:20.440 --> 12:24.390
If we don't head toward the light,
the whirlpools will block our way.

12:25.470 --> 12:27.989
A whirlpool ahead!

12:27.990 --> 12:31.690
Changing directions!

12:41.400 --> 12:45.089
So this is the sea Sadeena
and Raphtalia's parents crossed?

12:45.090 --> 12:46.120
That's right.

12:47.350 --> 12:50.330
My father and mother
crossed this sea too...

12:52.940 --> 12:55.109
That's a nasty whirlpool.

12:55.110 --> 12:56.210
Yeah.

12:56.650 --> 13:00.119
Why is your master in Q'ten Lo, anyway?

13:00.120 --> 13:01.260
Who knows.

13:01.620 --> 13:03.729
Chasing women,

13:03.730 --> 13:06.990
running from debt collectors.
He's been all over the place.

13:07.480 --> 13:09.099
Sounds like a hopeless person.

13:09.100 --> 13:12.809
He's full of problems,
but his skill is top-class.

13:12.810 --> 13:17.169
I was so taken with a weapon he made
that I decided to become his apprentice.

13:17.170 --> 13:18.679
That much, huh?

13:18.680 --> 13:22.840
If I can meet him again, I feel like I could
take my skills up another level.

13:23.200 --> 13:27.209
If he's that good, maybe I should
switch from you to him.

13:27.210 --> 13:29.580
Hey now, don't say that.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.980
Did you find anything around?

13:36.500 --> 13:40.799
Just like Sadeena said, I can sense
a dragon's presence in the distance.

13:40.800 --> 13:42.890
Is it the Water Dragon?

13:43.160 --> 13:45.990
Yeah. I tried approaching it,

13:46.360 --> 13:48.099
but a barrier blocked the way.

13:48.100 --> 13:50.140
Water Dragon's barrier...

13:50.720 --> 13:53.130
We'll be entering Q'ten Lo's
territorial waters shortly!

13:54.930 --> 13:56.229
Fog?

13:56.230 --> 13:58.930
I just hope we can make it without incident.

13:59.970 --> 14:02.279
These are the same people
who attacked our village.

14:02.280 --> 14:04.570
I doubt they'll just let us land.

14:05.060 --> 14:06.840
Stay on guard!

14:19.210 --> 14:22.550
Something's approaching
from the starboard aft!

14:24.590 --> 14:27.410
A ship! At this rate, we'll collide!

14:36.770 --> 14:38.730
Wind Arrow!

14:42.450 --> 14:43.489
Master Naofumi!

14:43.490 --> 14:44.570
Let's go!

14:45.490 --> 14:46.870
What's the ruckus?

15:01.510 --> 15:04.009
Death to the false Heavenly Emperor!

15:04.010 --> 15:06.139
Tornado Throw!

15:06.140 --> 15:07.760
Shooting Star Bow!

15:08.940 --> 15:11.399
Death to the false Heavenly Emperor!

15:11.400 --> 15:12.520
Leave it to me!

15:12.940 --> 15:15.219
As the source of thy power,
I command thee...

15:15.220 --> 15:20.649
Decipher the laws of nature
and let thunder strike my foes!

15:20.650 --> 15:23.070
All Drifa Chain Lightning!

15:27.960 --> 15:29.369
That's way too reckless!

15:29.370 --> 15:31.080
Zweite Aura!

15:32.560 --> 15:34.040
Thanks, Naofumi!

15:35.910 --> 15:38.630
I'd like to capture them alive
and get some information...

15:43.010 --> 15:46.069
Don't let them blow themselves up!
Take them down first!

15:46.070 --> 15:46.589
Yes!

15:46.590 --> 15:47.339
Got it!

15:47.340 --> 15:49.000
Understood!

15:50.050 --> 15:52.959
Big brother, this is no time to be seasick!

15:52.960 --> 15:54.470
I know!

15:55.310 --> 15:57.390
Stardust Blade!

15:59.730 --> 16:03.110
So the Hero's attacks
really don't work...

16:04.030 --> 16:06.199
Die! You false Heavenly Emperor!

16:06.200 --> 16:07.910
Air Strike Shield!

16:28.550 --> 16:30.259
Wait!

16:30.260 --> 16:32.790
Don't chase after them!
We're at a disadvantage underwater!

16:33.310 --> 16:35.479
We're finishing this, Gaelion!

16:35.480 --> 16:36.600
Lightning Strike Harpoon!

16:39.550 --> 16:41.199
Alright, just a little more!

16:41.200 --> 16:43.079
Glory to the Heavenly Emperor!

16:43.080 --> 16:44.110
Oh, no!

16:49.490 --> 16:50.619
Not on my watch!

16:50.620 --> 16:52.840
Shield Prison!

17:01.940 --> 17:03.899
You really saved us there.

17:03.900 --> 17:04.749
Yeah.

17:04.750 --> 17:07.210
No enemy ships in the area!

17:07.920 --> 17:10.430
Looks like we made it through.

17:10.860 --> 17:13.849
As long as we follow Master Naofumi's orders,

17:13.850 --> 17:16.180
it's useless for them to come
at us again and again.

17:16.950 --> 17:19.139
This is the same weapon as before.

17:19.140 --> 17:21.399
To attack in waters like this...

17:21.400 --> 17:24.690
That's how much
they don't want us to come.

17:25.210 --> 17:28.060
I just hope we can make it
to Q'ten Lo safely.

17:49.420 --> 17:51.850
Naofumi! Raphtalia!

17:52.840 --> 17:54.639
Master Naofumi!

17:54.640 --> 17:55.680
Atla, don't!

18:21.980 --> 18:23.230
Where are we?

18:24.040 --> 18:25.459
You alright?

18:25.460 --> 18:26.149
Yes...

18:26.150 --> 18:27.250
Thank goodness.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.980
So you were here.

18:30.200 --> 18:32.519
You two got caught up in the tornado too?

18:32.520 --> 18:36.159
Yeah. Looks like the Water Dragon
brought us here.

18:36.160 --> 18:38.830
I confirmed it in the whirlpool as well.

18:39.550 --> 18:41.159
The Water Dragon...

18:41.160 --> 18:44.269
It didn't have to bring us
here like this, though.

18:44.270 --> 18:47.960
Exactly. What's the point
of doing it this way?

18:49.370 --> 18:52.070
Apparently, it had something
urgent to tell us.

18:52.770 --> 18:53.720
This is?

18:54.150 --> 18:56.089
It's a fragment of the Dragon Emperor.

18:56.090 --> 18:59.530
It seems the Water Dragon's
message is sealed inside.

19:00.080 --> 19:02.729
Is it safe? If you go berserk again...

19:02.730 --> 19:06.330
There's no trace of the Demon Dragon Emperor's
presence. It shouldn't be a problem.

19:07.560 --> 19:09.959
Hmm. I see.

19:09.960 --> 19:11.460
You figured something out?

19:12.060 --> 19:16.199
It seems the Water Dragon's wish is
for you to return this country

19:16.200 --> 19:18.720
to its original state.

19:19.040 --> 19:20.970
Its original state?

19:21.610 --> 19:25.690
The ports of this country have
long been sealed by barriers.

19:26.460 --> 19:30.680
Those barriers are to protect something called
the "Mediator of the Spirit Implements."

19:31.070 --> 19:33.509
Mediator of the Spirit Implements?

19:33.510 --> 19:35.670
I don't know the details,

19:36.010 --> 19:39.319
but your family has been passing down
that role for generations.

19:39.320 --> 19:40.010
Eh?

19:41.150 --> 19:44.749
Raphtalia, have you ever heard anything
about this from your father?

19:44.750 --> 19:47.710
I'm sorry, I never heard
anything about that.

19:48.110 --> 19:51.319
He probably thought it was something
you didn't need to know.

19:51.320 --> 19:52.329
Yes...

19:52.330 --> 19:53.420
Spirit Implements...

19:53.980 --> 19:57.630
From the looks of it, don't you think
that's referring to the Holy Weapons?

19:58.040 --> 19:59.969
I think so too.

19:59.970 --> 20:02.309
Then, this "mediator" is...

20:02.310 --> 20:03.720
From the sound of it,

20:04.080 --> 20:07.600
someone in a position to restrain
the wielder of a Holy Weapon.

20:08.250 --> 20:12.099
For example, if a Hero abused
the power of their Holy Weapons,

20:12.100 --> 20:17.150
someone capable of opposing that power
could prevent the worst-case scenario.

20:18.590 --> 20:22.370
Maybe their weapons might
be based on that technology?

20:22.920 --> 20:24.450
Master Naofumi?

20:25.220 --> 20:28.969
So in the end, what exactly
are we supposed to do?

20:28.970 --> 20:30.539
It seems the barriers around Q'ten Lo

20:30.540 --> 20:33.550
are being controlled by
the Heavenly Emperor faction.

20:33.830 --> 20:38.469
Unless we restore it to normal,
our allies won't be able to land.

20:38.470 --> 20:39.639
What?

20:39.640 --> 20:40.550
Raph-chan?!

20:53.570 --> 20:57.419
They're stuck going in circles
and can't make progress.

20:57.420 --> 21:00.049
Just as the Water Dragon said, huh.

21:00.050 --> 21:03.050
We couldn't get in even if
we had kept going.

21:03.430 --> 21:07.420
There must be a base nearby
controlling the barrier.

21:15.420 --> 21:18.260
It's annoying to be moved
around at their whim,

21:19.420 --> 21:21.200
but let's head outside.

21:23.480 --> 21:24.550
What's this?

21:25.170 --> 21:29.559
The Water Dragon has prepared a change
of clothes to keep your identity hidden.

21:29.560 --> 21:31.270
Talk about well prepared.

21:37.420 --> 21:38.690
Glowing sakura tree?

21:39.530 --> 21:42.550
That's the Q'ten Lo's native tree,
the Sakura Light Tree.

21:50.120 --> 21:53.850
A lot's happened, but it looks like
we finally made it here.

21:55.680 --> 21:59.410
This is the country where my father
and mother were born.

23:36.190 --> 23:40.800
#7 LANDING IN Q'TEN LO
